        "### 3. Generate Financial Analysis\n",
        "Now we prompt the model to analyze the images and provide a structured summary."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 1000
        },
        "id": "b17bdaf2",
        "outputId": "2b482e6a-efb0-41c8-c64e-c4fd8e560fac"
      },
      "source": [
        "from IPython.display import display, Markdown\n",
        "\n",
        "prompt = \"\"\"\n",
        "Analyze the provided financial document images and provide a structured summary including:\n",
        "1. Key Financial Metrics (Revenue, Net Income, EPS, Growth Trends).\n",
        "2. Balance Sheet Highlights (Assets, Liabilities, Equity).\n",
        "3. Credit Quality and Operational Performance.\n",
        "4. Strategic and Operational Updates.\n",
        "5. Market Conditions and Outlook.\n",
        "6. Identification of risks or anomalies found in graphs and charts.\n",
        "\n",
        "Format the output to be professional and suitable for investors and analysts, similar to a quarterly report summary.\n",
        "\"\"\"\n",
        "\n",
        "if images:\n",
        "    response = model.generate_content([prompt] + images)\n",
        "    print(\"--- Financial Report Analysis ---\\n\")\n",
        "    display(Markdown(response.text))\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    print(\"No images available to analyze. Please upload 'figures_at_a_glance.png' and 'balance_sheet.png' to the /content/ folder.\")"
      ],
